(4*x^2).sqrt() -> 2*x
R(0).squarefree_decomposition() -> ArithmeticError: square-free decomposition of 0 is not defined
R(5).squarefree_decomposition() -> 5
R(0).radical() -> ZeroDivisionError: 
R(5).radical() -> 1
((y + a)^3 * (y + 1)).squarefree_decomposition() -> (y + 1) * (y + a)^3
